格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A personal DSH browser plugin: persistent profile, visible window, human-in-the-loop login, and safe agent browser tools.","id":"gh:1334605635","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-browser-companion","slug":"Tianyu209/dsh-browser-companion","topics":["agent","browser","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A personal DSH browser plugin: persistent profile, visible window, human-in-the-loop login, and safe"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" agent browser tools."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-browser-companion"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A personal DeepSeek Harness (DSH) browser plugin."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"It gives your agent a **dedicated, persistent, visible browser**:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- You can watch what the agent is doing in a real browser window.\n- Logins are done by you in the po"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"pup window; passwords and OAuth secrets never pass through the agent.\n- Cookies and login state are "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"saved in the same profile, so logins persist across restarts."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- ✅ Persistent browser profile (cookies / localStorage / login state)\n- ✅ Visible window mode (defau"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"lt `headless: false`)\n- ✅ Human-in-the-loop login: `browser_login` opens a window and you type your "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"password / complete OAuth yourself\n- ✅ Agent tools: open, snapshot, click, type, press, screenshot, "},{"id":"p8s4","text":"see, select, check, upload, hover, scroll, tabs, status\n- ✅ Security guard: `browser_type` refuses t"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"o fill password fields\n- ✅ `browser_see` uses a local vision model (OpenAI-compatible) so the agent "},{"id":"p8s6","text":"can understand images / visual layouts when needed\n- ✅ Based on agent-browser, so the hard browser a"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"utomation is battle-tested"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Out-of-the-box"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The plugin works with zero configuration for basic browsing:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- Uses the bundled browser (agent-browser's Chromium) by default\n- Uses a default persistent profile"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" under `~/.dsh/browser-profile`\n- All basic tools work: open, snapshot, click, type, tabs, etc."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Optional settings can be changed in the DSH WebUI plugin settings:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- `executablePath`: set to your real Chrome/Edge to avoid login blocks (e.g. Google)\n- `visionBaseUr"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"l` / `visionModel`: enable `browser_see` with a local vision model\n- `profilePath`: use a custom bro"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"wser profile location"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"If `browser_see` is not configured, it returns a friendly message instead of breaking the agent."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 1. Install dependencies"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### 2. Install the plugin"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"From npm or GitHub (once published):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> **pnpm users:** when installing from GitHub, pnpm may block `agent-browser`'s build script.\n> Add "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"this to your profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml` and re-run:\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Or for local development, add this to `~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"See examples/dsh-browser-companion.config.yml for a full sample config with placeholders."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"> ⚠️ Never commit real paths, tokens, or personal profile data. Use the sample config and replace va"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"mmit real paths, tokens, or personal profile data. Use the sample config and replace values locally."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### 3. Restart DSH"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Agent Tools"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Tool | Description |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| `browser_open` | Open a URL (visible window by default) |\n| `browser_snapshot` | Get an accessibil"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ity snapshot with `@e1` refs |\n| `browser_click` | Click an element |\n| `browser_type` | Type text ("},{"id":"p30s3","text":"never into password fields) |\n| `browser_press` | Press a key |\n| `browser_screenshot` | Save a scre"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"enshot locally |\n| `browser_see` | Screenshot + local vision model description (use sparingly) |\n| `"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"browser_get_text` | Read element text |\n| `browser_get_url` / `browser_get_title` | Get URL / title "},{"id":"p30s6","text":"|\n| `browser_wait` | Wait for time / element / URL |\n| `browser_back` / `forward` / `reload` | Navig"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"ation |\n| `browser_select` | Select a dropdown option |\n| `browser_check` / `browser_uncheck` | Chec"},{"id":"p30s8","text":"k / uncheck a checkbox |\n| `browser_upload` | Upload files |\n| `browser_hover` | Hover an element |\n"},{"id":"p30s9","text":"| `browser_scroll` | Scroll the page |\n| `browser_tabs` / `browser_new_tab` / `browser_close_tab` / "},{"id":"p30s10","text":"`browser_switch_tab` | Tab management |\n| `browser_status` | Browser status |\n| `browser_login` | Op"},{"id":"p30s11","text":"en a visible login window for the user |\n| `browser_wait_login` | Wait until login completes (cookie"},{"id":"p30s12","text":" / URL) |\n| `browser_close` | Close the browser (profile is kept) |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Typical Login Flow"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## How the Agent “Sees” a Page"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- **Default:** `browser_snapshot` — fast, free accessibility tree with refs.\n- **Only when needed:**"},{"id":"p34s2","text":" `browser_see` — screenshot + local vision model, for images / visual layout / complex UI."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| Key | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| `profilePath` | `~/.dsh/browser-profile` | Persistent profile directory |\n| `headless` | `false` |"},{"id":"p37s2","text":" Show browser window |\n| `defaultTimeout` | `30000` | Per-operation timeout (ms) |\n| `agentBrowserPa"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"th` | auto-detect | Override agent-browser CLI path |\n| `executablePath` | auto | Chrome/Edge execut"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"able path (recommended for Google login) |\n| `browserArgs` | `--disable-blink-features=AutomationCon"},{"id":"p37s5","text":"trolled` | Extra browser launch args |\n| `visionBaseUrl` | `http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1` | Local vision"},{"id":"p37s6","text":" model endpoint |\n| `visionModel` | `your-vision-model` | Local vision model name |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Security Notes"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- The agent is instructed never to fill password fields.\n- Passwords and OAuth secrets are entered b"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"y the user in the visible browser window.\n- For stronger protection, future versions can add encrypt"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"ed cookie storage and proxy-based credential injection."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
